{block beforeContent}
<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <div class="p-5 text-white bg-dark">
                <h3>Media</h3>
                <p class="lead">We co-operate with physicians, publish scientific papers, participate on conferences and scientific lectures. With our project we also participate in scientific competitions. And when we are successful, we are glad to show it.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{/block}

{block content}

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
        <h4>Technology in Diabetology</h4>
        <p>We are regular presenters at the leading, Czech diabetology congress - Technology in Diabetology.</p>
        <p>
        <img class="img-rounded" src="{$baseUrl}/img/techdia.jpg" alt="Technologie v diabetologii" width="100%">
        </p>
        <a href="http://www.technologiedia.cz/" title="Technologie v diabetologii" class="btn btn-dark">Technology in Diabetology <i class="fas fa-angle-double-right"></i></a>
        <div class="space-2em"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
        <h4>Outstanding Thesis Award</h4>
        <p>The master thesis "Monitoring of glucose levels with wearable devices" was awarded an "Oustanding master thesis" by STMicroelectronics on PESW 2018 conference.</p>
        <p>
        <img class="img-rounded" src="{$baseUrl}/img/pesw2018.jpg" alt="PESW2018" width="100%">
        </p>
        <a href="http://pesw.fit.cvut.cz/2018/" title="PESW2018" class="btn btn-dark">PESW2018 <i class="fas fa-angle-double-right"></i></a>
        <div class="space-2em"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
        <h4>Editor's choice in Computer Methods and Programs in Biomedicine</h4>
        <p>Our paper "Using meta-differential evolution to enhance a calculation of a continuous blood glucose level" has been selected for Editor's choice in Computer Methods and Programs in Biomedicine (a top-ranked scientific journal).</p>
        <p>
        <img class="img-rounded" src="{$baseUrl}/img/cmpb2016.jpg" alt="CMPB2016" width="100%">
        </p>
        <a href="http://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0169260716300128" title="CMPB2016" class="btn btn-dark">ScienceDirect <i class="fas fa-angle-double-right"></i></a>
        <div class="space-2em"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
        <h4>Nominated for the Werner von Siemens Prize</h4>
        <p>"Model of blood glucose level reconstruction from CGMS-sensor in subcutaneous tissue" was nominated for the Werner von Siemens Prize 2014, in the category of most important fundamental research.</p>
        <p>
        <img class="img-rounded" src="{$baseUrl}/img/siemens2014.jpg" alt="Werner von Siemens" width="100%">
        </p>
        <a href="https://www.cee.siemens.com/web/cz/cz/corporate/portal/home/Kariera/studenti_absolventi/cena_siemens/Pages/nominace-2014.aspx#" title="Werner von Siemens" class="btn btn-dark">www.cee.siemens.com <i class="fas fa-angle-double-right"></i></a>
        <div class="space-2em"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
        <h4>Cooperation with media</h4>
        <p>Do you need expert comment or would you like to speak with an expert directly? Are you interested in diabetes and would you like to write a paper or make a reportage? Then, we would like to meet you.</p>
        <p>
        <img class="img-rounded" src="{$baseUrl}/img/contact.jpg" alt="Kontakt" width="100%">
        </p>
        <a href="mailto:diabetes@mail.kiv.zcu.cz" title="Kontakt" class="btn btn-dark">Contact us <i class="fas fa-angle-double-right"></i></a>
        <div class="space-2em"></div>
    </div>
</div>